#ASSERT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a transfer sealed before and signed by a deposited attorney`
#ASSERT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a mortgage sealed before the Mother Superior and signed by a deposited attorney`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a conveyance sealed before and signed by an undeposited attorney`
#ASSERT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a deed sealed before another nun and signed by the Mother Superior`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a deed sealed before and signed by a former Mother Superior`
#ASSERT NOT `the signature is sufficient evidence the seal was duly affixed` `a document signed by the Mother Superior but never sealed`
